n/follow-through to direct cost**, with cited exposure of **$10k+ per incident** and discussion of **$300k/year** avoidable loss [01KWVK2M7QE21FXYB1NAHPY1GB]. That risk is not abstract; it shows up across delayed permitting, incomplete estimating, and procurement gaps. ## Critical decisions needed - **Hazmat bracket escalation:** authorize immediate escalation path beyond normal calls if Jason remains unresponsive; current plan already contemplates local office visit and alternate local vendor outreach [01KW9HBHD8S5PZBH5RB39F0328]. - **UQ Philipsburg execution choice:** force a yes/no on whether zero-disruption tie-in is truly guaranteed; if not, direct team to price/advance **option-B** now instead of waiting [outlook_AAMkADAwNzg3ZTA5LTJmMWEtNDczNi04ODcxLTk1MTA1ODhmYmIyNABGAAAAAAAU1WTKtGciQa9go1eRAG9JBwD__y9hPlJRRYxFT5QN_MgoAAAAAAEMAAD__y9hPlJRRYxFT5QN_MgoAARKD96wAAA=, outlook_AAMkADk2MTgxYzJhLTUzZjctNDIzZS05ZDkxLTg2NTcyNTRiOWRhYQBGAAAAAAC44Z9cGTA6SKuHAQ6MZsBABwDEL6z4g2_XQZJZM15izKp5AAAAAAEMAADEL6z4g2_XQZJZM15izKp5AAEmuRrKAAA=]. - **Pensacola RFQ clarifications:** domestic material requirement, delivery timing, and bran\",\n  \"hasCanonical\": false,\n  \"hasSources\": false,\n  \"hasSavedPacket\": true\n}"
